  "dcterms:description": "26 toxicity datasets published by the Integrated Chemical Environment (ICE), curated by NICEATM/ICCVAM at the U.S. National Toxicology Program (NTP), NIEHS. The brick downloads the ICE data tables (acute toxicity, cancer, DART, endocrine, exposure predictions, eye/skin irritation, mechanism-of-action panels, cHTS, etc.) as XLSX/ZIP from ice.ntp.niehs.nih.gov and converts each to Parquet. Upstream source is the U.S. federal government ICE portal.",
