  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by Claude annotation agent. The download stage fetches all files from ice.ntp.niehs.nih.gov (the ICE portal run by NICEATM/ICCVAM at NTP/NIEHS, a U.S. federal agency within HHS). Works of the U.S. Government are not subject to domestic copyright (17 U.S.C. 105) and are treated as public domain / US Government Work; the brick README asserts public domain. Classified open / permitted. CAVEAT for human review: ICE aggregates data curated with partner organizations, and some individual endpoint datasets may originate from third parties whose terms differ; I could not fetch an explicit machine-readable terms-of-use statement from ice.ntp.niehs.nih.gov (page returned no visible license text, and web-search budget was exhausted). Confidence is medium pending confirmation of the ICE portal's own data-use statement.",
